# User-generated custom gesture training data — must not be committed.
# The shipped models/custom_gestures.json is always an empty seed {}.
# Actual user recordings live in %LOCALAPPDATA%\SmartGestureOS\custom_gestures\.
# If you record samples locally and want to inspect them, do so via GestureTrainer,
# not by committing the file. Reset with: echo {} > models\custom_gestures.json
/models/custom_gestures_local_*.json
